OL,3,GNEWSAAccused said he would 'stain'
OL,4,Akilled boy, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of murdering a
OL,7,F15-year-old in a row over money told a
OL,8,Fschool friend he was "gonna stain this
OL,9,Fyout" days before the attack, jurors
OL,10,Fhave heard.
OL,12,FThe defendant and another teenager both
OL,13,Fdeny murdering Luis Guembes in Stoke
OL,14,FPark, Guildford in January.
OL,16,FIn a police interview played to
OL,17,FGuildford Crown Court the witness said
OL,18,Fthe slang term, which he had heard
OL,19,Fpreviously on social media, means to
OL,20,Fkill someone.
